WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Original Intro: The production 19-frame intro, including its original fade into frame 19.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Load LFM: Two-second illustrative loading progress for the release-default LFM model; not a benchmark.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Type and Send: Type 'what can you do?' on the production on-screen keyboard and explicitly select SEND.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Sample Reply: Predefined sample text streams through the production reply renderer; no model runs.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Read aloud: offline synthesized speech.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.817
I can help with short questions, draft

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:25.520
text, and explain ideas. I run locally

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.790
on this handheld. This is a scripted

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.770
demo, not a live AI answer.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
R2: VOICE settings. Select USB and TEST MICROPHONE. No real microphone access.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
VISUAL DEMO: simulated recording. Nothing is captured.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Prerecorded synthetic sample, not live microphone audio: This is a microphone test. Your voice stays on the device.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
VISUAL DEMO: verdict uses the prerecorded sample's waveform, not a microphone.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Dictate and Review: Select MIC, simulate recording and transcription, review the draft, then explicitly SEND a second sample question.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Reopen History: Open in-memory sample history, navigate between entries, and reopen the walkthrough conversation.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Close the App: Pause on the reopened chat, then show STOP and fade out as the scripted app closes.
